      "writtenOn": "2024-01-18T12:21:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I personally prefer using the stock exec and then https://github.com/google/skia-buildbot/blob/main/go/executil/executil.go to stub out executions rather than the exec in infra. How much churn would that cause?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 745,
