      "writtenOn": "2024-01-18T12:21:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Idea for tightening up the syntax a bit - makeCommandCollector takes variadiac commandAndResults, we add a helper function with a variadic string input that returns commandAndResult, and add a method to commandAndResult to specify what the stdout is.\n```\nmakeCommandCollector(t,\n  cmdAndArgs(\"adb\", \"shell\", \"su\", \"root\", \"rm\", \"-rf\", \"/sdcard/bazel-adb-test.tar.gz\", \"/data/bazel-adb-test\", \"/sdcard/bazel-adb-test-output-dir\"),\n  cmdAndArgs(\"adb\", \"root\"),\n  ...\n  cmdAndArgs(\"adb\", \"shell\", \"cat /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu4/online\").withstdout(\"0\\n\"),\n  ...\n)\n```",
      "range": {
